  "body": "**Issue**\r\nDrag preview set using DataTransfer.setDragImage is blurry on retina screen. It's because image is displayed in it's natural size. It doesn't matter if I generate 2x image because there's no way to set width/height in DataTransfer.setDragImage.\r\n\r\n**Solution**\r\n\r\n```\r\nevent.dataTransfer.setDragImage(img, xOffset, yOffset, width, height)\r\n// or\r\nevent.dataTransfer.setDragImage(img, {\r\n  width: 100 // example for image size 200px x 200px\r\n  height: 100\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Related**\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dom-datatransfer-setdragimage",
